              "LEV.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aroni nee daaqaywós hara'ayaarí baweek: Gaarí an dabér ilahhooár da/a/aangw. Ilahhooár da/a/aangw kan gawaá kitángw ilahhooárí máy xweera sleémeero ay matlaatle, kan ásltí gutlhhún, asltós miwa gwá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó tsitaywós kuduú kahamuusi'iima, kudá' taa tleéhh ar kitaáni gun dahaas gawaá daanduú surwaánirós tidá' ya'a' ququmát wa ale, tidá' taa tleéhh ar kitaáni. Inós da/aradár gawaá kitángw ilahhooár da/a gari hingees, gari qaas bihhaá kitángw ilahhooa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy tlabaadá' i kon giri duux, tlabaá hatlá' giri dahaas, da/ara gari huuw didá' taa fiíts ar xafto guruú tsee/a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asltá gawaá kitángw ilahhooa gár kawa hariím inós gan gutlhhún as miwa baloó gwá'. Umuúqo matlaatleero kaahamusmoó Mungú migír gun baraá ásltí qamín, inós ilahhooár da/a gan qoomeemees. Gawaá asltadaádae wahhanadá' gan daa/ as wayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asla in kumaamít ohmaango gawaá kitángw ilahhooár wa ale, miwa baloó gwá'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gaarí a dabér ilahhooár bu'uungw: Daaqoó Aroni gan haniis dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gawaá kitangwduú ilahhooa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamusmoó wák tsa/oó wák oo puurú gun taataahh ilahhooár balángw wa alé dinkwa nee di/i, nee mooyángw tsuú', sleémeero gari daa/ gawaá kitángw ilahhooa, tawa inslaslaangw, slaahhareeriiwós AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguri sla'atisiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Puuruú aa meet kaahamusmo Aroni nee daaqaywós ngun /ayiyá', ngun didá' hhoohhoo' ar baraá afeenár heémár Mungú wa /ayiyá', ala ku sluuftisiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ló' mukuwa humín, sleeme mukuwa sluuftís. Qoomayhúng ngwaa haniís baraá ilahhooarír da/to tindi amor'eé' hanimiisi. A ilahhooár ló'wa hhoohhoo' adór ilahhooár tlakweema hingeesa nee ar dakuús hingeesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo hhawaatuwo baraá xwaylár Aroniwo an múk hariím gaarí kawa /ayi, asma kana paraátl umuú daqto as inooín, dír ilahhooadá'' ta dír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ i da/a/ana. Umuúqo heewo oo gaa kwatiit aqo in hhoohhooúy.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
